      "publish_date": "2026-08-19",
      "excerpts": [
        "CDMO Live Americas Oct 20–21, Boston · Download Agenda →\nCDMO News\nVectorBuilder Partners With Lir Therapeutics to Advance AI-Engineered AAV Capsids\nCOMPANY PROFILE\nVectorBuilder\n* VectorBuilder and Lir Therapeutics have entered a strategic collaboration to develop AAV capsids designed for biological performance, manufacturability and scalability.\n* The companies will combine VectorBuilder’s DeepCap platform with Lir’s AI-powered nAAVigator platform to optimize selected capsids from design through manufacturing assessment.\nVectorBuilder and Lir Therapeutics have entered a strategic collaboration to develop adeno-associated virus (AAV) capsids that address both biological performance and manufacturing requirements for gene therapy development.\nThe companies will combine VectorBuilder’s expertise in AAV discovery, capsid engineering, process development and GMP manufacturing with Lir’s nAAVigator artificial intelligence platform.\nUnder the collaboration, Lir will use its AI-powered nAAVigator platform and laboratory optimization workflow to enhance selected capsids discovered through VectorBuilder’s DeepCap platform."
